---
import BaseHead from "../components/BaseHead.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from "../consts";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <BaseHead
            title={`Contact - ${SITE_TITLE}`}
            description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}
        />
    </head>
    <body>
        <Header />
        <main>
            <h1>contact me</h1>
            <p>
                if you want to contact me, you can do so in various ways. some
                methods will lead to a quicker response than others.
            </p>
            <p>
                <b>please specify that you are contacting me from my site;</b> and,
                where possible, <b
                    >please specify what you're contacting me about in your
                    initial message.</b
                > this saves time for both of us!
            </p>
            <h2>recommended</h2>
            <p>
                <b>
                    (if you want or need a quick response, please use one of
                    these!)
                </b>
            </p>
            <p>
                you can message me on <b>Discord</b> (<code>@rexogamer</code>).
                this is probably the fastest way of getting in touch with me.
            </p>
            <p>
                I also use <b>Stoat</b> (<code>@Rexogamer#3096</code>); note
                that, for Clerotri support, you'll probably want
                <a href={"https://stt.gg/clerotri"}>the support server</a> instead.
            </p>
            <p>
                in terms of social media, I almost exclusively use the
                <b>Fediverse</b> (<a href="https://st.transbus.social/@rexo"
                    ><code>@rexo@st.transbus.social</code></a
                >) and <b>Bluesky</b> (<a
                    href="https://bsky.app/profile/@rexowo.dev"
                    ><code>@rexowo.dev</code></a
                >). please note that <b
                    >I almost certainly won't respond to Bluesky DMs</b
                > because I usually can't see them.
            </p>
            <p>
                I also have <b>Signal</b>; I'm a bit hesitant about sharing my
                account, but if i's entirely necessary you can ask for it via
                another method.
            </p>
            <h2>other methods</h2>
            <p>
                (you <i>can</i> use these, but <b>
                    don't expect a quick response.
                </b> if you can use one of the methods above instead, please do!)
            </p>
            <p>
                you can <b>email</b> me at <a
                    href="mailto:beartechtalks@gmail.com?subject=[ENQUIRY]&body=(I'm here from your website.)"
                    target="_blank">
                    <code>beartechtalks@gmail.com</code>
                </a>; responses will be slightly slower, but you should get a
                reply within a week. for Clerotri enquiries, please use <a
                    href="mailto:clerotri@upryzing.app"
                    target="_blank">
                    <code>clerotri@upryzing.app</code>
                </a> instead.
            </p>
            <p>
                you can message me on <b>Matrix</b>
                (<code>@rexogamer:mozilla.org</code>). I'm not huge on Matrix
                and don't check it as often.
            </p>
        </main>
        <Footer />
    </body>
</html>
